{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"uk-universal-credit UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Hii inaonyesha kupungua kwa mapato tu na haichungi uwezekano au kuhesabu tuzo kamili ya Mikopo ya Kimataifa. Inadhani tuzo ya juu kabla ya mapato tayari yamejulikana. Kupungua kwa ZXQPH0000QXZ hutumika juu ya ada ya kazi iliyochaguliwa: £ZXQPH0001QXZ na msaada wa makazi, £ZXQPH0002QXZ bila msaada wa makazi, au £ZXQPH0003QXZ ikiwa hakuna ada ya kazi hutumika. Matukio maalum na vipunguzo vingine vimeondolewa. Kanuni ni kwa ZXQPH0004QXZ–ZXQPH0005QXZ na lazima yafanyiwe marekebisho kabla ya ZXQPH0006QXZ Aprili ZXQPH0007QXZ","record_id":"7e93bf694a65932c9ab1587b13738f2eed76d1de0f8cf3027322b853e9953669","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":4.709285474250009,"source":"This illustrates the earnings taper only and does not check eligibility or calculate a full Universal Credit award. It assumes the maximum award before earnings is already known. The 55% taper applies above the selected work allowance: £427 with housing support, £710 without housing support, or £0 if no work allowance applies. Special cases and other deductions are excluded. Rules are for 2026–27 and must be reviewed before 6 April 2027.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"4a5506124846288e6347287158891c1e308abc590a854560b4a430683b0dab07","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Hii inaonyesha kupungua kwa mapato tu na haichungi uwezekano au kuhesabu tuzo kamili ya Mikopo ya Kimataifa. Inadhani tuzo ya juu kabla ya mapato tayari yamejulikana. Kupungua kwa 55% hutumika juu ya ada ya kazi iliyochaguliwa: £427 na msaada wa makazi, £710 bila msaada wa makazi, au £0 ikiwa hakuna ada ya kazi hutumika. Matukio maalum na vipunguzo vingine vimeondolewa. Kanuni ni kwa 2026–27 na lazima yafanyiwe marekebisho kabla ya 6 Aprili 2027","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
